// Workspace table inventory
//
// What it looks for: every table in the workspace with at least one row,
// ranked by event count.
//
// Why it matters: your investigation is only as good as your visibility. Before
// writing a detection, you need to know which tables actually hold data, not
// which ones the portal says exist. A table that looks connected but has zero
// rows produces a rule that never fires and a query that returns nothing —
// which reads as "no findings" rather than "no data."
//
// What a hit means: run this first in any unfamiliar workspace. Empty tables
// are a data-collection problem to raise, not a query to keep rewriting.

union withsource=TableName *
| summarize Events = count() by TableName
| sort by Events desc
